<qti-assessment-item xmlns="http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/imsqtiasi_v3p0" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/imsqtiasi_v3p0 https://purl.imsglobal.org/spec/qti/v3p0/schema/xsd/imsqti_asiv3p0_v1p0.xsd" identifier="pcb-item-5bfeac0a6d6a4a889d96e1305851b634" title="Quick Check: Divisive (precision)" adaptive="true" time-dependent="false">
  <qti-response-declaration identifier="RESPONSE" cardinality="single" base-type="identifier">
    <qti-correct-response><qti-value>B</qti-value></qti-correct-response>
  </qti-response-declaration>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="SCORE" cardinality="single" base-type="float">
    <qti-default-value><qti-value>0</qti-value></qti-default-value>
  </qti-outcome-declaration>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="FEEDBACK" cardinality="single" base-type="identifier"/>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="INTERACTION_VISIBILITY" cardinality="single" base-type="identifier">
    <qti-default-value><qti-value>show_interaction</qti-value></qti-default-value>
  </qti-outcome-declaration>
  <qti-item-body>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="show_interaction" outcome-identifier="INTERACTION_VISIBILITY" show-hide="show" class="qti-margin-0">
      <qti-content-body>
        <p>Choose the word that best completes the sentence.</p>
    <p>Although some menu items sparked disagreement among restaurant critics, most dishes were universally loved; the selection was ____ rather than universally agreed upon.</p>
    <qti-choice-interaction response-identifier="RESPONSE" shuffle="true" max-choices="1">
      <qti-simple-choice identifier="A">divisive</qti-simple-choice>
      <qti-simple-choice identifier="B">controversial</qti-simple-choice>
      <qti-simple-choice identifier="C">contentious</qti-simple-choice>
      <qti-simple-choice identifier="D">polarizing</qti-simple-choice>
    </qti-choice-interaction>
      </qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>

    <qti-feedback-block identifier="CORRECT" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show">
      <qti-content-body><p>Correct! Controversial is the best choice because it indicates disagreement on some items without the deeper sense of opposing camps that divisive implies. Since most dishes were loved, divisive would overstate the depth of the split. Contentious emphasizes heated arguing rather than the split itself. Polarizing suggests extreme opposing positions. Divisive describes something that causes strong disagreement and splits people into opposing sides.</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="INCORRECT" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show">
      <qti-content-body><p>Divisive describes something that causes strong disagreement and splits people into opposing sides. Controversial is the best choice because it indicates disagreement on some items without the deeper sense of opposing camps that divisive implies. Since most dishes were loved, divisive would overstate the depth of the split. Contentious emphasizes heated arguing rather than the split itself. Polarizing suggests extreme opposing positions. All four words are close in meaning, but the best fit here is: &quot;controversial&quot;</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
  </qti-item-body>
  <qti-response-processing>
    <qti-response-condition>
      <qti-response-if>
        <qti-match><qti-variable identifier="RESPONSE"/><qti-correct identifier="RESPONSE"/></qti-match>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE"><qti-base-value base-type="float">1</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">CORRECT</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="completionStatus"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">completed</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="INTERACTION_VISIBILITY"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">hidden</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
      </qti-response-if>
      <qti-response-else>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE"><qti-base-value base-type="float">0</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">INCORRECT</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="completionStatus"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">incomplete</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
      </qti-response-else>
    </qti-response-condition>
  </qti-response-processing>
</qti-assessment-item>